WEBVTT

01:47.840 --> 01:48.680
Your Highness.

01:49.160 --> 01:51.120
This letter is from the Chief Secretariat.

01:51.720 --> 01:53.440
Return the letter to him as is.

01:54.360 --> 01:56.760
Tell him that since he hurt my sister,

01:56.840 --> 01:58.440
don't expect me to forgive him.

01:58.520 --> 02:00.320
He said that this letter

02:00.400 --> 02:01.720
is about Mrs. Jiang.

02:04.840 --> 02:05.760
Bring it here.

02:12.560 --> 02:13.760
MADAM JI MISSES YOU
DESPITE HER CONDITION

02:13.840 --> 02:15.280
PLEASE VISIT HER WHEN YOU'RE AVAILABLE

02:40.560 --> 02:41.440
Shuran.

02:42.600 --> 02:43.440
Shuran.

02:43.520 --> 02:44.760
- "Shuran"?
- Shuran.

02:45.840 --> 02:48.200
Miss, you are so beautiful!

02:48.840 --> 02:50.360
It's me, Shuran.

02:50.440 --> 02:51.680
Don't you recognize me?

02:52.760 --> 02:55.160
Let me put a flower on you.

02:56.760 --> 02:58.000
What a beauty.

02:59.760 --> 03:00.640
Shuran.

03:07.840 --> 03:08.920
Who is he?

03:12.680 --> 03:13.640
Father?

03:14.520 --> 03:16.040
Are you here to see me, Father?

03:16.760 --> 03:18.040
You came to see me?

03:19.320 --> 03:22.240
I… I will give you a flower.

03:23.000 --> 03:24.200
Let me put it on your head.

03:25.880 --> 03:26.800
Chancellor Jiang,

03:27.600 --> 03:28.880
what's the meaning of this?

03:29.600 --> 03:30.480
Giving a carrot

03:31.280 --> 03:33.760
and expecting I'd forget what you did?

03:34.360 --> 03:37.320
This new house is much better
than the ancestral shrine.

03:38.040 --> 03:40.400
Here, there are flowers and plants
which she likes

03:40.480 --> 03:43.000
and maids who serve her patiently.

03:44.000 --> 03:47.000
From now on, she will surely spend

03:47.080 --> 03:50.040
her later years here without any worries.

03:50.120 --> 03:53.080
You are so fierce, miss.

03:55.680 --> 03:57.640
Li'er is also here today.

03:58.120 --> 04:01.320
She hopes to speak
with Your Highness face-to-face.

04:04.000 --> 04:04.840
Li'er!

04:29.960 --> 04:32.000
Consort Li, please have some tea.

04:32.080 --> 04:35.360
Are you threatening me
with my sister today?

04:36.000 --> 04:37.240
Your Highness has misunderstood.

04:38.400 --> 04:39.800
This is a gesture of goodwill.

04:39.880 --> 04:42.480
After all, Your Highness already know

04:42.560 --> 04:43.680
what my mother did before.

04:44.600 --> 04:46.760
Now, my mother can enjoy this kind of life

04:47.760 --> 04:49.880
all thanks to Your Highness.

04:52.240 --> 04:53.400
Then what do you want from me?

04:53.960 --> 04:57.520
I heard that
it was Your Highness' idea to grant

04:57.600 --> 04:58.840
my marriage with Shen Yurong.

04:59.400 --> 05:01.600
You yourself said
that you are both in love.

05:01.680 --> 05:04.560
I just did a good deed.

05:05.360 --> 05:07.480
Since Your Highness worries
about my marriage,

05:07.560 --> 05:08.920
I am naturally grateful for it.

05:09.000 --> 05:10.400
I am just worried

05:11.160 --> 05:13.120
that Your Highness
will end up like my mother,

05:13.640 --> 05:16.400
being treated as a pawn
by the Eldest Princess.

05:17.960 --> 05:18.840
What are you saying?

05:19.400 --> 05:21.840
When Jiang Ruoyao
knocked Zhou Yanbang unconscious,

05:21.920 --> 05:23.320
I testified for Ruoyao.

05:23.400 --> 05:24.880
Since then,

05:24.960 --> 05:27.080
Ruoyao stopped listening to Mother.

05:27.160 --> 05:29.160
Mother thought that I urged Ruoyao on,

05:29.240 --> 05:30.680
so she wanted to kill me.

05:31.680 --> 05:32.520
The Eldest Princess

05:32.600 --> 05:34.480
keenly discovered this.

05:35.040 --> 05:37.040
After returning to the capital
to petition to His Majesty,

05:37.520 --> 05:40.360
the Eldest Princess wants me dead.

05:40.440 --> 05:43.280
My mother's intention to get rid of me
ultimately gave the Eldest Princess

05:43.360 --> 05:45.240
a chance to let someone else
do the dirty work.

05:46.720 --> 05:48.120
To survive,

05:48.200 --> 05:50.160
I could only retaliate
with all my strength.

05:51.040 --> 05:53.360
That's why things ended up this way today.

05:53.440 --> 05:56.720
You've washed your hands
of what happened so well.

05:57.400 --> 05:59.800
It doesn't matter if I am innocent or not.

06:00.760 --> 06:04.720
What matters is the Eldest Princess
is targeting Your Highness.

06:05.280 --> 06:06.520
As far as I know,

06:07.640 --> 06:09.680
granting marriage
between Shen Yurong and I

06:09.760 --> 06:11.320
wasn't Your Highness' idea.

06:11.400 --> 06:13.320
Your Highness was coerced as well.

06:14.840 --> 06:15.680
You…

06:16.600 --> 06:17.920
What do you know?

06:18.000 --> 06:21.400
I know that Your Highness
is the same as I was in the past,

06:21.480 --> 06:22.880
under threat by the Eldest Princess.

06:23.840 --> 06:25.320
With her way of doing things,

06:25.400 --> 06:27.080
if the root of the problem
is not resolved,

06:27.160 --> 06:29.200
she'll only coerce you
over and over again.

06:29.760 --> 06:31.040
Your Highness can consider it.

06:31.520 --> 06:34.840
If Your Highness is willing
to work with me,

06:35.720 --> 06:37.840
I can help solve Your Highness's problem.

06:38.800 --> 06:42.440
And my mother can also live peacefully
in this small estate.

06:43.400 --> 06:44.880
And we'll be even.

06:45.480 --> 06:46.400
How does that sound?

06:52.480 --> 06:54.120
Flower.

06:57.960 --> 06:59.000
Your Highness,

06:59.080 --> 07:01.600
I hope my daughter didn't offend you.

07:02.240 --> 07:03.320
I finally know

07:04.120 --> 07:06.560
why those who wanted to harm Jiang Li

07:06.640 --> 07:08.240
all failed and paid the price in the end.

07:08.800 --> 07:09.640
Chancellor Jiang,

07:10.280 --> 07:12.800
your daughter is really something.

07:13.480 --> 07:14.920
Thank you, Your Highness.

07:24.000 --> 07:24.840
Shuran.

07:32.520 --> 07:33.360
Chancellor Jiang,

07:34.480 --> 07:37.760
Shuran is the most important person
to me in this world.

07:40.120 --> 07:42.800
We got to where we are today

07:43.720 --> 07:45.040
by supporting each other.

07:45.680 --> 07:48.080
Seeing that you have reconciled
with Shuran,

07:49.120 --> 07:51.880
my grudge against the Jiang family
is now water under the bridge.

07:53.120 --> 07:55.760
However, I can't forgive you

07:56.280 --> 07:57.280
for driving Shuran mad.

07:58.360 --> 08:00.000
Although my sister was wrong
in the first place,

08:00.800 --> 08:03.840
Jiang Li must pay the price.

08:04.880 --> 08:07.840
There is no room for maneuver
on the matter of granting the marriage.

08:08.400 --> 08:10.280
On account of your kindness to Shuran,

08:11.040 --> 08:12.680
I won't drag the Jiang family down.

08:13.480 --> 08:15.200
I hope you understand the principle

08:15.280 --> 08:17.560
of making a minor sacrifice
to preserve what's crucial.

08:18.120 --> 08:21.160
A parent should protect his child

08:22.040 --> 08:24.360
and would never abandon her

08:24.440 --> 08:26.360
to protect himself.

08:26.440 --> 08:27.800
You don't know what's good for you.

09:06.480 --> 09:09.080
PRINCESS WANNING'S MANSION

09:40.400 --> 09:41.560
Your Highness,

09:41.640 --> 09:44.640
Jiang Yuanbai brought Ji Shuran
to a new house.

09:44.720 --> 09:46.960
However, Consort Li did not waver.

09:54.360 --> 09:55.760
Your Highness is very clever.

09:56.400 --> 09:57.880
They'd only humiliate themselves

09:58.520 --> 10:00.080
in begging Consort Li now.

10:00.160 --> 10:02.840
Consort Li is
an unreliable pawn after all.

10:03.760 --> 10:05.040
Undue delay may bring trouble.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.480
We shouldn't wait any longer.

10:09.840 --> 10:12.240
Do you want me to request
a decree from His Majesty?

10:16.280 --> 10:17.720
Why do I feel like

10:17.800 --> 10:19.600
you are in a hurry to be granted marriage?

10:20.920 --> 10:24.160
Naturally, I want to fulfill
Your Highness' wishes at the soonest.

10:27.840 --> 10:28.680
Yurong,

10:29.960 --> 10:33.360
did Xue Fangfei teach you
how to play the guqin?

10:36.040 --> 10:37.200
She can't teach me.

10:37.760 --> 10:39.600
She plays it so well.

10:40.280 --> 10:41.760
You played a song together last time.

10:42.360 --> 10:43.360
Why don't you two

10:43.440 --> 10:44.880
perform for His Majesty, Consort Li,

10:44.960 --> 10:46.240
and me again?

10:46.880 --> 10:47.880
Why?

10:50.200 --> 10:53.840
Won't this allow Consort Li
to take advantage of the situation

10:54.400 --> 10:58.080
and suggest granting your marriage
to His Majesty?

11:03.720 --> 11:06.080
There are many ways to push
the granting of the marriage.

11:10.240 --> 11:12.080
But I want to see

11:13.600 --> 11:15.840
how two people who hate each other

11:16.440 --> 11:18.920
can play in perfect harmony together.

11:19.600 --> 11:20.960
Won't you be sad, Your Highness?

11:24.200 --> 11:25.440
Did you ask

11:26.920 --> 11:28.240
out of guilt?

11:29.400 --> 11:30.760
If Your Highness wishes to see it,

11:31.240 --> 11:32.960
I'll perform it.

11:56.480 --> 11:57.840
Ms. Jiuyue gave this to me herself.

11:58.520 --> 12:00.000
I didn't open it along the way.

12:16.560 --> 12:17.400
Your Majesty.

12:22.480 --> 12:24.160
Why did you suddenly come
to the imperial study to see me?

12:24.240 --> 12:25.080
Is something wrong?

12:25.160 --> 12:27.520
I heard Your Majesty has been
reviewing memorials the whole day.

12:27.600 --> 12:29.640
That's why I especially brought you
some dessert.

12:30.160 --> 12:32.280
You are always so considerate of me.

12:32.360 --> 12:33.680
Your birthday is in two days.

12:33.760 --> 12:35.400
Have you decided on your gift?

12:35.480 --> 12:37.360
Thank you, Your Majesty,
for always remembering.

12:38.080 --> 12:40.680
I don't want any gifts.

12:40.760 --> 12:43.880
I just kept thinking about the time
when the Zhao delegation came.

12:43.960 --> 12:47.120
I caught a cold that day
and was unable to attend the banquet.

12:47.200 --> 12:51.080
I heard that Ms. Jiang Li and Mr. Shen

12:51.160 --> 12:52.760
performed like a match made in heaven.

12:54.560 --> 12:56.920
It's a pity that I have no chance
to see it again.

12:57.520 --> 12:58.720
What's so difficult about that?

12:59.560 --> 13:00.520
Eunuch Su.

13:00.600 --> 13:01.880
Yes, Your Majesty.

13:01.960 --> 13:03.320
Relay my verbal order.

13:03.400 --> 13:04.960
On Consort Li's birthday,

13:05.040 --> 13:07.240
invite Ms. Jiang Li and Mr. Shen
to attend the banquet.

13:08.080 --> 13:09.000
Yes.

13:09.760 --> 13:11.480
I also want to invite someone else.

13:12.960 --> 13:16.560
Wanning was grounded during that time
and missed out on the performance too.

13:16.640 --> 13:18.760
Why not ask her to join us?

13:19.320 --> 13:20.160
Sure.

13:20.640 --> 13:21.920
I have the same thoughts.

13:32.880 --> 13:34.560
- Jiang Li!
- Jiang Li!

13:35.440 --> 13:36.920
- Jiang Li. Are you all right?
- Jiang Li. Are you all right?

13:37.640 --> 13:38.680
I'm fine.

13:39.240 --> 13:40.640
Stop pretending in front of us.

13:40.720 --> 13:41.640
We know that Consort Li

13:41.720 --> 13:44.000
wants to grant
you and Shen Yurong marriage.

13:44.560 --> 13:46.400
Why did you retract your testimony
for no reason?

13:48.840 --> 13:51.120
You fool, if it weren't
for some unspeakable reason,

13:51.200 --> 13:52.800
would Jiang Li retract her statement?

13:54.040 --> 13:55.760
The situation is a little tricky now.

13:56.640 --> 13:57.960
I'm thinking of a way.

13:59.240 --> 14:00.400
Ye Shijie is here too.

14:01.200 --> 14:02.360
He's chatting with Uncle Yuanbai.

14:03.000 --> 14:04.080
What are they talking about?

14:06.040 --> 14:07.480
Of course it's about your marriage.

14:12.640 --> 14:13.480
Jiang Li!

14:20.280 --> 14:22.080
My lord, aren't I awesome?

14:22.160 --> 14:24.000
I found someone who hid herself so well.

14:25.440 --> 14:26.280
My lord,

14:27.440 --> 14:28.920
something's going on in the Jiang family.

14:29.560 --> 14:32.040
Consort Li invited Jiang Li
and Shen Yurong to her birthday banquet.

14:32.120 --> 14:35.280
I'm afraid she wants
to arrange their marriage on-site.

14:35.960 --> 14:36.960
Which day is it?

14:37.440 --> 14:38.440
After two days.

14:38.520 --> 14:39.920
Just now, the scout also said

14:40.000 --> 14:41.560
Chancellor Jiang invited Ye Shijie over.

14:43.760 --> 14:45.440
What is he doing there at this time?

14:47.560 --> 14:49.200
What? He invited Ye Shijie?

14:49.280 --> 14:50.120
Yes.

14:50.200 --> 14:51.600
Don't worry, Mr. Jiang.

14:51.680 --> 14:53.480
I'll definitely help in this matter.

14:54.880 --> 14:55.720
Good.

14:59.400 --> 15:00.560
I'll take my leave then.

15:06.560 --> 15:08.640
Great, Li'er is here too.

15:09.680 --> 15:10.560
Li'er,

15:11.360 --> 15:13.320
we were talking about you.

15:13.880 --> 15:15.000
What about?

15:15.080 --> 15:17.040
Shijie, tell her.

15:20.200 --> 15:22.920
We know that Shen Yurong
asked to be granted marriage to you.

15:23.520 --> 15:25.200
I know you must be reluctant to marry him,

15:25.680 --> 15:27.400
so I will see His Majesty

15:27.480 --> 15:29.640
and say our families arranged
our marriage before we were born.

15:30.480 --> 15:32.160
His Majesty takes
civil traditions seriously

15:32.240 --> 15:34.840
and will certainly take back
the order to grant this marriage.

15:34.920 --> 15:36.600
That is to deceive His Majesty.

15:36.680 --> 15:38.760
I've already coordinated
with the Ye family about this.

15:39.240 --> 15:40.320
We are not afraid.

15:40.400 --> 15:42.720
Mr. Jiang has also agreed.

15:43.360 --> 15:45.920
I trust Shijie.

15:46.480 --> 15:49.520
This is the best option at the moment.

15:49.600 --> 15:50.480
There's no need.

15:50.960 --> 15:52.400
You don't have to worry about this.

15:52.480 --> 15:54.720
We're just doing this
to solve your urgent predicament.

15:54.800 --> 15:56.520
If you don't want to marry me
in the future,

15:58.000 --> 15:59.720
we can break off the engagement.

16:01.800 --> 16:04.520
Marriage is of great importance.

16:04.600 --> 16:07.640
What's more,
my reputation is already damaged.

16:07.720 --> 16:09.160
I don't want to drag you down.

16:09.240 --> 16:11.360
What if I say that I am willing
to get dragged down?

16:21.240 --> 16:23.200
But I am not.

16:25.040 --> 16:28.160
We are really pressed for time
and have no time to plan.

16:28.720 --> 16:31.080
A message just came from the palace.

16:31.160 --> 16:33.040
On Consort Li's birthday,

16:33.120 --> 16:36.640
you and Shen Yurong are invited
to the palace in celebration.

16:36.720 --> 16:38.760
But no one else
from the Jiang family is invited.

16:38.840 --> 16:42.320
I think she wants to grant
the marriage between you two

16:42.400 --> 16:43.440
right before His Majesty.

16:44.320 --> 16:46.720
That's why I asked Shijie to come over.

16:49.360 --> 16:50.640
You can mull it over.

16:52.040 --> 16:53.800
- At any time, I--
- Ms. Jiang Li.

16:54.960 --> 16:56.840
Duke Su is waiting for you
outside the gate.

16:58.040 --> 17:00.800
Since Duke Su is here,
why didn't he come in?

17:01.400 --> 17:02.680
This concerns Ms. Jiang Li.

17:03.280 --> 17:05.599
Ms. Jiang Li,
please go outside to talk to him.

17:05.680 --> 17:07.240
What's the meaning of this?

17:08.200 --> 17:10.560
Father, I'll go out for a moment.

17:30.280 --> 17:31.280
Where are we going?

17:31.760 --> 17:32.680
To the palace.

17:33.240 --> 17:34.560
Why are we going to the palace?

17:36.520 --> 17:38.240
I'll ask His Majesty to grant us marriage.

17:43.360 --> 17:44.480
Duke Su,

17:45.520 --> 17:47.080
look at the situation now.

17:47.720 --> 17:49.240
Please stop joking.

17:56.160 --> 17:57.080
What's this?

17:57.600 --> 18:00.200
The confession of the palace maid
involved in Consort Xian's death.

18:03.960 --> 18:05.320
You found her so quickly?

18:05.880 --> 18:07.480
My men

18:07.560 --> 18:09.640
aren't like the useless people
under Wanning.

18:10.360 --> 18:12.040
Where is the maid now?

18:12.520 --> 18:13.920
I hid her.

18:14.000 --> 18:16.280
I had someone
disguise herself as that palace maid,

18:16.360 --> 18:18.520
so they're not alerted for now.

18:19.400 --> 18:20.240
So,

18:20.720 --> 18:23.120
we are going into the palace
to meet Consort Li now.

18:23.200 --> 18:25.040
You are the one who is going
to see Consort Li.

18:25.680 --> 18:26.920
I'm going to see His Majesty.

18:27.000 --> 18:28.720
Why are you seeing His Majesty?

18:29.280 --> 18:30.440
To ask him to grant me marriage.

18:49.200 --> 18:51.000
Can you visit the palace at will?

18:51.640 --> 18:52.880
Who brought you in?

18:53.720 --> 18:54.960
That does not matter.

18:55.040 --> 18:57.760
Your Highness should be
worried about this instead.

18:57.840 --> 18:58.800
ZHANG MANNI'S CONFESSION

19:10.640 --> 19:12.280
UNDER CONSORT LI'S THREAT, I PUT
VOODOO POISON IN CONSORT XIAN'S FOOD

19:15.040 --> 19:15.880
Where did you get this?

19:15.960 --> 19:17.120
I told you before.

19:17.840 --> 19:19.560
I can help solve your problem,
Your Highness.

19:20.360 --> 19:21.920
Can Your Highness trust me now?

19:23.040 --> 19:25.440
I have truly underestimated you
time and time again.

19:26.920 --> 19:28.240
Who is your backer?

19:28.800 --> 19:31.960
That's not what Your Highness
should be concerned about now.

19:32.040 --> 19:33.600
What exactly do you want?

19:34.160 --> 19:35.360
I am different from Wanning.

19:36.080 --> 19:37.680
I won't threaten Your Highness with this.

19:38.720 --> 19:41.600
I am just begging Your Highness
to stop being Wanning's puppet

19:42.160 --> 19:43.920
and stop interfering
with granting marriage.

19:44.000 --> 19:46.520
Then I will return this maid
to Your Highness.

19:47.320 --> 19:48.600
Even if I don't mention it,

19:49.520 --> 19:51.600
do you think Wanning will just give up?

19:52.600 --> 19:54.440
What happened between you and Mr. Shen

19:54.520 --> 19:56.240
is pushed to the cusp
of public opinion now.

19:57.000 --> 19:58.680
Even without my help,

19:59.240 --> 20:01.720
Wanning will also
take advantage of the situation

20:01.800 --> 20:02.800
and make it happen.

20:03.360 --> 20:06.040
I've been planning this for a long time.

20:06.920 --> 20:08.160
I'm just one step away now.

20:08.920 --> 20:12.720
I need a favor from Your Highness
on your birthday banquet.

20:14.120 --> 20:15.120
What is it?

20:22.760 --> 20:24.960
Xiao Heng, don't go too far!

20:25.040 --> 20:25.920
I've gone too far?

20:26.000 --> 20:27.760
When Shen Yurong
asked to be granted marriage,

20:27.840 --> 20:29.000
why didn't Your Majesty refuse him?

20:29.080 --> 20:31.200
Isn't it just a marriage?
Why are you so worked up?

20:31.280 --> 20:33.400
Your Majesty knows clearly
that I like Ms. Jiang Li.

20:33.480 --> 20:35.120
What would I do now?

20:35.200 --> 20:37.400
Everyone knows about them
in the Imperial Court.

20:37.480 --> 20:38.720
I don't want their families
to be embarrassed.

20:38.800 --> 20:40.480
This is the best solution!

20:40.560 --> 20:42.400
- Has Your Majesty made up your mind?
- Xiao Heng,

20:42.480 --> 20:43.840
I advise you to drop this matter.

20:44.560 --> 20:45.520
I'll go ahead!

20:50.200 --> 20:53.640
BENEFITTING THE PEOPLE

20:54.360 --> 20:55.520
What did you do just now?

20:56.360 --> 20:57.560
Why do you look so tired?

20:58.760 --> 20:59.600
Nothing.

21:00.720 --> 21:01.760
I just had a quarrel.

21:05.120 --> 21:06.840
You're really the first person

21:07.320 --> 21:08.520
to quarrel with His Majesty.

21:11.000 --> 21:12.280
You look relaxed.

21:13.000 --> 21:14.200
Did you two reach an agreement?

21:14.280 --> 21:15.880
Consort Li agreed to help me.

21:16.520 --> 21:17.480
Help you with what?

21:19.080 --> 21:20.160
I won't tell you yet.

21:22.320 --> 21:23.840
Even if you suppressed Consort Li,

21:24.560 --> 21:26.240
on her birthday,

21:26.320 --> 21:28.560
if Eldest Princess personally
asks to grant your marriage,

21:29.360 --> 21:30.480
how would you reject it?

21:31.120 --> 21:32.560
Even if the marriage is granted,

21:33.080 --> 21:35.360
it'll take at least a month
to prepare for the wedding banquet.

21:35.840 --> 21:37.200
In one month,

21:37.280 --> 21:38.480
I can make them

21:38.560 --> 21:39.880
cancel the engagement themselves.

21:41.480 --> 21:42.400
That's not a good idea.

21:42.880 --> 21:44.920
- It's just in name.
- Even that won't do.

21:53.080 --> 21:56.960
Tell me, can't you serve me
in the future anymore?

21:57.760 --> 22:00.440
We'll have a lot of time together.

22:04.720 --> 22:08.360
I feel particularly uneasy today.

22:09.360 --> 22:11.720
I don't feel comfortable
seeing you either.

22:15.280 --> 22:17.720
In that case, I shall excuse myself.

22:22.240 --> 22:24.160
Your Highness,
Duke Su requests to see you.

22:25.520 --> 22:26.560
What a rare visitor.

22:28.760 --> 22:31.440
Didn't you say that he personally

22:31.520 --> 22:34.000
went to pick up Xue Fangfei at the prison?

22:34.600 --> 22:35.440
Yes.

22:36.720 --> 22:37.800
Make yourself scarce.

22:51.320 --> 22:53.600
Duke Su, you wouldn't be here
for no reason.

22:54.320 --> 22:55.480
Why did you come here today?

22:55.960 --> 22:59.040
If Shen Yurong cannot become
a Prince Consort,

22:59.120 --> 23:01.000
won't it be a pity, Your Highness?

23:01.560 --> 23:03.280
If I want something,

23:03.360 --> 23:05.160
I can retrieve it at any time.

23:05.720 --> 23:08.000
Ordinary people can't compare
to Your Highness' magnanimity.

23:09.560 --> 23:10.880
I've always been petty.

23:11.360 --> 23:15.160
Naturally, I won't give away
the person I like.

23:16.840 --> 23:17.840
Are you referring to…

23:17.920 --> 23:20.320
What will it take to cancel
the granting of Jiang Li's marriage?

23:22.920 --> 23:25.600
Duke Su, you're truly dedicated to her.

23:25.680 --> 23:28.720
But I lost a lot of things
because of Jiang Li.

23:29.520 --> 23:30.760
How can you compensate them?

23:30.840 --> 23:32.760
How much have you lost?
I will pay you back.

23:34.600 --> 23:36.480
I want a lot of things.

23:37.240 --> 23:38.240
You can't afford them.

23:40.880 --> 23:42.280
Is this enough?

24:13.840 --> 24:16.640
AUSPICIOUS, GOOD, KIND, GENTLE

24:16.720 --> 24:17.960
What a coincidence.

24:19.840 --> 24:22.480
Ms. Jiang Li, you're also invited.

24:23.680 --> 24:25.320
It's all thanks
to Consort Li's generosity.

24:25.800 --> 24:28.480
Ms. Jiang Li, you're really lucky.

24:29.280 --> 24:32.120
I'm a little envious.

24:37.240 --> 24:39.280
His Majesty has arrived.

24:39.360 --> 24:41.040
Consort Li has arrived.

24:42.920 --> 24:45.880
- Welcome, Your Majesty, Your Highness.
- Welcome, Your Majesty, Your Highness.

24:51.680 --> 24:52.800
There's no need for courtesy.

24:52.880 --> 24:54.400
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

25:05.720 --> 25:07.200
Today is Consort Li's birthday.

25:07.280 --> 25:08.840
She doesn't want an extravagant banquet,

25:08.920 --> 25:10.720
so I invited all of you here.

25:10.800 --> 25:12.760
Consort Li keeps telling me

25:13.320 --> 25:16.440
about the performance
of Minister Shen and Ms. Jiang Li.

25:16.520 --> 25:17.760
Can the both of you

25:17.840 --> 25:20.080
perform together again today?

25:23.920 --> 25:25.800
I am extremely honored.

25:27.280 --> 25:29.440
I am willing to play for Her Highness.

25:30.120 --> 25:30.960
Good.

25:31.720 --> 25:33.800
I have also invited Wanning here today.

25:33.880 --> 25:35.640
She made a scene
in the Imperial Court before

25:35.720 --> 25:37.360
and I had her grounded
to reflect on herself.

25:37.440 --> 25:38.880
Today, I invited her here

25:38.960 --> 25:40.200
in the hopes that everyone

25:40.280 --> 25:41.600
can get along amicably.

25:42.360 --> 25:43.640
Of course, Your Majesty.

25:43.720 --> 25:46.840
Naturally, I'll take the high road.

25:47.480 --> 25:48.600
That's good.

25:48.680 --> 25:50.240
Let's have some food first

25:50.320 --> 25:51.680
and start the performance later.

26:33.840 --> 26:35.320
Mr. Shen, Ms. Jiang Li,

26:35.400 --> 26:36.880
please wait here.

26:44.040 --> 26:45.320
When you look at me,

26:46.560 --> 26:47.480
other than disgust,

26:48.760 --> 26:50.560
there's a hint of love mingled with hate.

26:50.640 --> 26:52.040
I didn't know

26:53.120 --> 26:55.200
that you have no self-awareness at all.

26:55.280 --> 26:56.760
Self-awareness?

26:57.600 --> 26:59.240
What about myself should I be aware of?

27:00.680 --> 27:03.360
Do you know that if you insist
on going against the Eldest Princess,

27:03.920 --> 27:05.280
things won't end well for you?

27:05.360 --> 27:06.640
Why are you marrying me then?

27:07.640 --> 27:10.160
Do you want to use me again
to please the Eldest Princess?

27:11.360 --> 27:12.920
You still don't trust me.

27:13.000 --> 27:14.560
I once trusted you.

27:15.480 --> 27:16.920
But what happened?

27:21.720 --> 27:23.360
Is your trust only reserved

27:25.040 --> 27:26.680
for a man like Xiao Heng?

27:27.240 --> 27:29.280
If I have the same background as him,

27:29.360 --> 27:30.560
I wouldn't have to do this.

27:31.920 --> 27:32.760
Will you believe me

27:33.320 --> 27:35.480
if I say I can also trade
the Longwu Army for you?

27:40.240 --> 27:41.600
Is this enough?

27:41.680 --> 27:43.880
Is this the fish talisman
of the Longwu Army?

27:43.960 --> 27:46.440
Since you know it,
I need not explain further.

27:47.000 --> 27:49.040
If you give me that,

27:49.120 --> 27:50.800
the nation will have a new ruler.

27:50.880 --> 27:52.960
I don't care who rules the nation.

27:55.640 --> 27:56.760
I only want her.

27:59.000 --> 28:00.240
It turns out you didn't know.

28:01.320 --> 28:04.040
Now that I have told you,
you can feel at ease.

28:04.720 --> 28:05.960
Starting tomorrow,

28:06.040 --> 28:07.880
no one will mention
granting the marriage again.

28:08.920 --> 28:10.760
Even if His Majesty brings it up again,

28:11.720 --> 28:12.880
I will refuse it.

28:14.080 --> 28:15.000
After all,

28:16.920 --> 28:19.120
that's the fish talisman
of the Longwu Army.

28:20.000 --> 28:21.120
I'm very curious.

28:21.840 --> 28:24.760
If His Majesty knew that Xiao Heng
handed over the Longwu Army

28:24.840 --> 28:26.280
for a woman,

28:26.360 --> 28:28.480
would his punishment be
confiscation of possessions

28:29.520 --> 28:31.200
or nine familial exterminations?

28:37.920 --> 28:38.800
Your Majesty.

28:38.880 --> 28:41.320
Mr. Shen and Ms. Jiang Li are ready.

28:42.200 --> 28:43.360
Let them begin then.

29:52.760 --> 29:55.680
If His Majesty knew that Xiao Heng
handed over the Longwu Army

29:55.760 --> 29:56.920
for a woman,

29:57.520 --> 29:59.480
would his punishment be
confiscation of possessions

30:00.280 --> 30:02.200
or nine familial exterminations?

30:43.240 --> 30:45.040
You really know how to fool around.

30:45.600 --> 30:47.920
Although I am not an expert in the guqin,

30:48.520 --> 30:50.480
I've heard a lot of good tunes.

30:51.080 --> 30:52.640
Ms. Jiang Li,

30:52.720 --> 30:55.320
do you think Consort Li and I

30:55.400 --> 30:57.200
don't deserve to hear your music?

30:59.040 --> 30:59.880
Forget it.

31:00.440 --> 31:04.240
Previously, Ms. Jiang Li
and Mr. Shen rehearsed daily,

31:04.320 --> 31:05.920
so the performance must've been excellent.

31:06.000 --> 31:08.200
Today, it was my sudden wish

31:08.280 --> 31:09.720
for them to perform.

31:11.120 --> 31:12.040
Nevertheless,

31:12.120 --> 31:14.080
I can consider my regret of missing

31:14.160 --> 31:15.920
the alliance banquet fulfilled today.

31:17.360 --> 31:18.200
Come on.

31:18.280 --> 31:19.840
Let's drink.

31:19.920 --> 31:23.000
Eldest Princess Wanning
rarely visits the palace.

31:23.080 --> 31:25.880
This Nv'erhong wine
is especially prepared for you.

31:25.960 --> 31:28.480
Try and see if it's to your liking.

31:35.400 --> 31:36.440
Mr. Shen,

31:37.080 --> 31:38.800
you have seen Ms. Jiang Li

31:38.880 --> 31:40.280
- win first place
- Here.

31:40.360 --> 31:41.400
in the School of Integrity.

31:42.080 --> 31:43.480
Do you think

31:43.560 --> 31:46.880
her performance today
is the same level as before?

31:47.720 --> 31:49.760
From what I know about Ms. Jiang Li,

31:51.920 --> 31:53.560
she can play much better than this.

31:53.640 --> 31:56.000
Maybe Ms. Jiang Li's focus

31:56.080 --> 31:56.920
is elsewhere.

31:57.680 --> 31:58.520
Is that so?

31:59.000 --> 32:02.120
Then who is Ms. Jiang Li thinking about?

32:03.080 --> 32:07.280
Is he more important
than His Majesty and Her Highness?

32:07.800 --> 32:10.080
Your Majesty, Your Highness Consort Li,

32:10.160 --> 32:11.000
Your Highness,

32:11.480 --> 32:12.320
please forgive me.

32:14.000 --> 32:16.080
I was indeed distracted today.

32:17.040 --> 32:19.000
It's true that I am thinking of someone.

32:19.560 --> 32:20.560
Then let's hear it.

32:21.240 --> 32:22.520
I am thinking

32:22.600 --> 32:24.280
about Xue Zhao, the son of Magistrate Xue

32:24.360 --> 32:26.720
who was rescued from Huaixiang before,

32:27.920 --> 32:29.040
I heard he was found.

32:32.600 --> 32:35.640
Come to think of it,
it was Eldest Princess who inspired me.

32:36.840 --> 32:39.520
Eldest Princess always said
that I am Xue Fangfei before.

32:39.600 --> 32:41.160
She said that Xue Fangfei is not dead,

32:41.760 --> 32:43.480
so that gave me an idea.

32:44.040 --> 32:46.520
I wondered if Magistrate Xue's son
have survived too.

32:47.840 --> 32:52.400
That's why I asked Duke Su
to help find him.

32:53.480 --> 32:56.240
Before coming today, Duke Su told me

32:56.320 --> 32:57.680
that he found him.

32:57.760 --> 32:59.000
I'm thinking

32:59.080 --> 33:01.320
that when Xue Zhao regains consciousness,
we can ask him

33:01.400 --> 33:02.840
and help Mr. Shen

33:02.920 --> 33:05.800
find the person who harmed
his father-in-law and brother-in-law.

33:06.480 --> 33:07.320
Great.

33:07.400 --> 33:09.680
In this case, let Duke Su handle it.

33:10.240 --> 33:12.080
If this is useful to the case later on,

33:12.160 --> 33:13.560
you will gain merit for this.

33:14.960 --> 33:15.920
Thank you, Your Majesty.

33:16.640 --> 33:19.080
But it's a fact
that I got distracted today.

33:19.640 --> 33:21.520
I am willing to perform another tune

33:21.600 --> 33:24.200
with Mr. Shen, "Huaixiang Ditty".

33:26.280 --> 33:27.760
A tune that has not been rehearsed

33:27.840 --> 33:29.520
should not be presented to Your Majesty.

33:29.600 --> 33:31.760
Mr. Shen should be very familiar
with "Huaixiang Ditty".

33:33.000 --> 33:35.280
If you've forgotten it
because of leaving home for too long,

33:39.000 --> 33:40.600
why don't you just be an audience?

33:42.640 --> 33:44.520
That sounds good.

33:45.080 --> 33:46.560
A local ditty

33:46.640 --> 33:49.760
should be more interesting
than a grand and serious song.

33:50.400 --> 33:51.440
Get started then.

33:52.760 --> 33:53.600
Yes.

34:41.960 --> 34:42.840
"Huaixiang Ditty".

34:44.199 --> 34:45.480
Dear, you're feeling homesick.

34:47.320 --> 34:50.880
I'm reminded of the time I first met you.

34:51.880 --> 34:52.920
Do you still remember?

34:53.000 --> 34:54.679
How can I forget it?

35:52.760 --> 35:54.080
Did you give the Longwu Army

35:54.160 --> 35:55.720
to the Eldest Princess for me?

35:56.560 --> 35:57.440
You found out?

35:58.040 --> 36:00.200
- This is the method you spoke of?
- Yes.

36:00.280 --> 36:02.960
No one mentioned
granting the marriage today, right?

36:04.280 --> 36:06.040
The fish talisman is so important.

36:06.520 --> 36:08.320
How can you give it away so easily?

36:09.280 --> 36:11.840
Didn't I say I have a solution?

36:12.680 --> 36:15.000
You are talking about
what you asked from Jiuyue?

36:15.080 --> 36:16.520
You already know about it.

36:17.000 --> 36:18.680
Then why did you give away
the fish talisman?

36:19.520 --> 36:20.360
I just guessed it.

36:20.840 --> 36:23.120
But I don't know
what exactly it is that you want.

36:26.760 --> 36:29.440
We have to find a way to retrieve
the fish talisman quickly.

36:33.920 --> 36:36.440
I've never seen you this panicked.

36:37.000 --> 36:39.320
This is not about me, it concerns you.

36:41.760 --> 36:43.040
Does this mean

36:43.120 --> 36:44.960
I am very important to you?

36:46.000 --> 36:47.200
Xiao Heng!

36:49.280 --> 36:50.280
All right.

36:51.040 --> 36:51.920
Actually,

36:52.000 --> 36:54.840
handing over the fish talisman
is just a part of our plan.

36:54.920 --> 36:55.760
"Our"?

36:57.000 --> 36:58.000
Who?

36:58.600 --> 36:59.760
His Majesty and I.

37:03.040 --> 37:04.440
What exactly is going on?

37:06.400 --> 37:08.160
Wanning's backer is Prince Cheng.

37:08.840 --> 37:10.760
Prince Cheng has always been
eyeing the throne.

37:11.320 --> 37:12.360
As long as he stands,

37:12.440 --> 37:14.000
His Majesty can never be at ease.

37:14.080 --> 37:16.800
In the past eight years, Prince Cheng
achieved many military merits up north,

37:16.880 --> 37:17.840
winning the hearts of the people.

37:18.880 --> 37:21.880
Many children in the north today
do not know His Majesty,

37:21.960 --> 37:23.640
but only a few do not know Prince Cheng.

37:23.720 --> 37:25.920
Prince Cheng is establishing
his prestige this way,

37:26.000 --> 37:28.840
gradually establishing a good image
of a brave and caring leader,

37:29.360 --> 37:31.320
so he can legitimately recruit troops.

37:32.440 --> 37:35.440
Isn't Prince Cheng afraid
of overshadowing the Emperor?

37:37.000 --> 37:39.040
Maybe that's his intention.

37:39.600 --> 37:42.000
And if His Majesty suppresses
Prince Cheng for this reason,

37:42.560 --> 37:45.800
His Majesty would be seen
as a leader jealous of talents,

37:45.880 --> 37:47.480
unjustly punishing a decorated subject.

37:47.560 --> 37:48.600
If that happens,

37:48.680 --> 37:51.240
Prince Cheng would be justify
to have an uprising in the north.

37:51.320 --> 37:55.160
In the past eight years, Prince Cheng
has been recruiting troops in the north,

37:55.240 --> 37:58.680
and Wanning has been garnering support
in the Imperial Court and gathering money.

37:59.200 --> 38:00.960
In the Imperial Court,
Li Zhongnan's faction

38:01.040 --> 38:02.680
also willingly serves the two of them.

38:02.760 --> 38:05.160
They're corrupt and lawless.

38:05.720 --> 38:09.200
These people are like bones
in His Majesty's throat.

38:10.040 --> 38:12.320
He can't pull them out or swallow them.

38:12.840 --> 38:14.360
Left to their own devices,

38:14.440 --> 38:17.800
the forces in the north
will shake the nation sooner or later

38:18.840 --> 38:21.520
and every official will be afraid of them.

38:22.000 --> 38:24.200
If Prince Cheng launches a coup then,

38:24.840 --> 38:26.560
the local army

38:26.640 --> 38:29.760
might turn against us to protect
their families and themselves.

38:30.320 --> 38:33.080
His Majesty and I
were unable to find an opening before.

38:36.560 --> 38:38.240
Until you appeared.

38:38.840 --> 38:39.680
Me?

38:40.640 --> 38:41.720
Am I that important?

38:41.800 --> 38:43.280
All this while,

38:43.360 --> 38:45.440
most of the things you wanted to do
aligned with my goals.

38:47.040 --> 38:48.840
Keep the Li family
from controlling the Ye family.

38:49.360 --> 38:50.840
Destroy Huaixiang's private gold mines.

38:51.680 --> 38:52.760
Even Xue Huaiyuan's case

38:52.840 --> 38:55.200
gave His Majesty a reason
to weaken Li Zhongnan.

38:55.680 --> 38:57.040
Originally, because of Shen Yurong,

38:57.120 --> 38:58.680
you have driven Wanning into a corner.

38:58.760 --> 39:02.120
I just didn't expect that Wanning
would have Xue Zhao

39:02.200 --> 39:03.880
and request the granting of your marriage.

39:04.360 --> 39:07.720
So His Majesty and I also set up a scheme.

39:09.160 --> 39:10.120
Are you crazy?

39:10.200 --> 39:12.640
How dare you hand the Longwu Army's
fish talisman to the Eldest Princess?

39:12.720 --> 39:14.080
Huaixiang 's private gold mine is gone.

39:14.160 --> 39:17.440
We also destroyed most of Li Zhongnan's
salt and iron business in the south.

39:17.520 --> 39:18.880
Li Zhongnan is gradually losing power.

39:18.960 --> 39:21.640
It's difficult for him to find new ways
to make money for Prince Cheng.

39:21.720 --> 39:23.880
How long does Your Majesty think
Prince Cheng is willing to wait?

39:24.680 --> 39:26.120
If he doesn't rebel,

39:26.200 --> 39:27.680
he'll only keep asking for food
from the Imperial Court,

39:27.760 --> 39:29.000
draining the Treasury.

39:29.080 --> 39:30.160
If Your Majesty refuses him,

39:30.240 --> 39:31.560
he'd even have a reason to rebel.

39:31.640 --> 39:34.440
When that time comes, the north
will be plunged into misery and suffering.

39:34.520 --> 39:36.200
People will be displaced.

39:36.280 --> 39:37.680
And the treasury of Great Yan

39:38.360 --> 39:40.360
will be emptied because of this battle.

39:41.040 --> 39:41.880
So?

39:41.960 --> 39:44.320
For the ancestral worship next month,
Prince Cheng will return to the capital.

39:44.400 --> 39:47.040
This is his chance,
but also our opportunity.

39:47.880 --> 39:48.880
Spell it out.

39:49.600 --> 39:51.960
Hand over the Longwu Army
and entice him into rebelling.

39:52.880 --> 39:54.400
Instead of rising in rebellion
in the north,

39:54.480 --> 39:55.560
let him force you to abdicate.

39:56.120 --> 39:57.520
If the Longwu Army is in our hands,

39:57.600 --> 39:58.880
he will be cautious.

39:59.440 --> 40:01.320
But once we hand over the Longwu Army,

40:01.400 --> 40:03.600
it would be like exposing
our vulnerability to him.

40:04.840 --> 40:07.440
He will surely grab this opportunity.

40:09.680 --> 40:10.760
This is a narrow gain.

40:11.480 --> 40:13.040
For your revenge, for a woman,

40:13.120 --> 40:14.760
you want to treat me as a pawn too?

40:14.840 --> 40:18.240
Your Majesty, if I only wanted revenge

40:18.320 --> 40:21.040
and cared not for the people
and the nation,

40:22.520 --> 40:23.960
why would I endure until now?

40:24.040 --> 40:25.160
How would you defeat him?

40:25.960 --> 40:27.840
Do you still have any aces
after handing over the Longwu Army?

40:27.920 --> 40:29.280
What about my safety?

40:29.360 --> 40:30.400
Great Zhao.

40:32.320 --> 40:34.120
Great Zhao is my trump card.

40:37.600 --> 40:38.840
If you can think of that,

40:38.920 --> 40:40.560
can't the Eldest Princess do the same?

40:40.640 --> 40:43.360
Wouldn't she realize that handing over
the Longwu Army is just a bait?

40:43.440 --> 40:46.240
That's why I have to pretend
like I am blinded by love.

40:46.720 --> 40:47.680
This is the only way

40:48.480 --> 40:50.560
to make Wanning accept
the Longwu Army without a doubt.

40:51.440 --> 40:52.280
Are you

40:53.520 --> 40:54.960
blinded or not?

40:55.520 --> 40:56.520
I'm thinking very clearly.

40:58.480 --> 40:59.960
Prince Cheng already has strong power.

41:00.040 --> 41:01.560
No matter what we plan,

41:01.640 --> 41:03.840
a fatal blow has the potential
to injure both parties.

41:05.040 --> 41:06.480
Your Majesty has trusted me
for eight years.

41:07.080 --> 41:08.600
Please trust me for one last time.

41:09.240 --> 41:12.120
I will use the lowest price
in exchange for the greatest victory.

41:12.880 --> 41:14.320
How should I cooperate with you then?

41:14.400 --> 41:15.640
Put on an act.

41:15.720 --> 41:16.680
How should I do that?

41:23.040 --> 41:24.760
Xiao Heng, don't go too far!

41:24.840 --> 41:25.720
I've gone too far?

41:25.800 --> 41:27.160
When Shen Yurong
asked to be granted marriage,

41:27.240 --> 41:28.160
why didn't Your Majesty refuse him?

41:28.240 --> 41:29.480
Isn't it just a marriage?

41:29.560 --> 41:30.560
Why are you so worked up?

41:30.640 --> 41:32.680
Your Majesty knows clearly
that I like Ms. Jiang Li.

41:32.760 --> 41:33.920
What would I do now?

41:36.360 --> 41:38.760
Everyone knows about them
in the Imperial Court.

41:38.840 --> 41:40.080
I don't want their families
to be embarrassed.

41:40.160 --> 41:41.400
This is the best solution!

41:41.480 --> 41:42.720
Has Your Majesty made up your mind?

41:42.800 --> 41:45.640
Xiao Heng,
I advise you to drop this matter.

41:46.400 --> 41:47.400
I'll go ahead!

41:47.480 --> 41:49.760
GOVERN PEOPLE, SERVE THE HEAVENS

41:51.760 --> 41:52.600
Good acting.

41:52.680 --> 41:54.920
I'll deduct the things you broke
from your salary.

42:01.840 --> 42:03.040
I see.

42:03.640 --> 42:06.200
You could have forged a fish talisman
and given it to Wanning.

42:06.880 --> 42:08.400
Why risk it with the real deal?

42:09.520 --> 42:10.960
Don't underestimate Wanning.

42:11.040 --> 42:12.160
With her capability,

42:12.240 --> 42:14.280
she can tell whether the fish talisman
is real or not.

42:14.360 --> 42:16.640
Then not only will we fail
to lure Prince Cheng out of his den,

42:16.720 --> 42:18.160
but we might also alert them of our plan.

42:18.240 --> 42:21.520
Will Great Zhao
really send reinforcements?

42:21.600 --> 42:23.720
This is the second thing
that I want to tell you.

42:23.800 --> 42:25.080
I'll head to Zhao for a few days.

42:25.560 --> 42:27.120
When are you setting off?

42:27.720 --> 42:28.800
In a few days.

42:30.040 --> 42:31.600
Before you go,

42:31.680 --> 42:32.760
I'll put on a show for you.

42:35.960 --> 42:38.320
Send some people to keep an eye
on Eldest Princess's Mansion.

42:41.960 --> 42:43.800
I have told you my secret.

42:44.560 --> 42:45.680
What about you?

42:45.760 --> 42:47.000
In front of you,

42:48.840 --> 42:50.760
I've long stopped hiding anything.

42:50.840 --> 42:52.680
I already know

42:52.760 --> 42:53.760
that you fancy me.

42:56.240 --> 42:58.160
But do you know

42:58.960 --> 42:59.800
that I fancy you?

43:22.240 --> 43:23.680
Yurong.

43:25.360 --> 43:27.760
You keep saying that you hate Xue Fangfei,

43:28.880 --> 43:30.760
but why did I see
something completely different

43:30.840 --> 43:32.160
at the imperial banquet?

43:32.240 --> 43:33.680
You've misunderstood, Your Highness.

43:34.520 --> 43:37.720
I was wondering if the fish talisman
might be a scam.

43:38.480 --> 43:40.120
After all, Xiao Heng is full of tricks.

43:40.840 --> 43:42.240
Handing over the fish talisman now

43:42.760 --> 43:43.640
is very fishy.

43:44.720 --> 43:46.680
This is the difference
between you and Xiao Heng.

43:48.200 --> 43:51.240
You can kill Xue Fangfei
just to stay alive,

43:52.040 --> 43:54.880
but Xiao Heng can die for Xue Fangfei.

43:55.440 --> 43:58.160
Your love is far behind his.

43:59.240 --> 44:01.640
Now, you're still talking to me
about the fish talisman?

44:01.720 --> 44:04.200
Do you still want a marriage
to be granted between you two?

44:05.360 --> 44:07.240
Or are you angry with me

44:07.840 --> 44:10.760
because the fish talisman
ruined your plan?

44:12.200 --> 44:13.840
I abide by your decision, Your Highness.

44:14.400 --> 44:15.240
I dare not do so.

44:17.640 --> 44:18.720
You just dare not

44:19.400 --> 44:20.320
or will not?

44:21.320 --> 44:22.280
Tell me.

44:22.840 --> 44:24.720
Can't Your Highness deduce

44:26.120 --> 44:27.360
my sincerity?

44:28.760 --> 44:29.600
Shen Yurong,

44:30.760 --> 44:32.480
why are you unwilling to give up on her?

44:33.520 --> 44:36.040
I don't understand
what's so good about her.

44:36.640 --> 44:39.080
She wanted to pull her bow
and kill you at the palace banquet.

44:39.560 --> 44:42.960
Now, she plotted
to ruin your life at your residence.

44:43.520 --> 44:44.720
You are so cheap,

44:45.360 --> 44:46.480
you still can't forget her.

44:51.440 --> 44:52.960
From the day I killed her,

44:53.760 --> 44:55.920
aren't I already a shameless person?

44:56.800 --> 44:58.640
Your Highness forced me
to become such a person.

44:59.360 --> 45:00.560
Have you regretted it now?

45:01.360 --> 45:03.080
Why don't you dare answer my question?

45:03.920 --> 45:05.280
Have you been lying to me?

45:05.840 --> 45:07.680
I never thought
about deceiving Your Highness.

45:08.360 --> 45:09.920
It's just that even I myself

45:10.480 --> 45:12.360
can't tell which words I say now

45:12.440 --> 45:14.200
are true

45:14.280 --> 45:15.280
and which are false.

45:16.480 --> 45:17.680
I'm tired.

45:18.200 --> 45:19.720
Your Highness must be tired as well.

45:20.320 --> 45:21.560
I'll come again another day.

45:26.240 --> 45:27.840
Shen Yurong, I dare you.

45:27.920 --> 45:30.200
Do you want me to send
the entire Shen family to the guillotine?

45:30.280 --> 45:32.880
If that pleases Your Highness,

45:32.960 --> 45:34.120
do it.
